  "description": "A full page with a further page below it - the only path that reaches :313. Twenty-five records are seeded: the ten of app/jcl/DUSRSECJ.jcl and fifteen synthetic ZUSERnnn records, whose keys sort after both ADMIN and USER so the file stays in ascending key order and the first ten records are always the real ones. The forward loop fills all ten rows, :309-310 computes page 1, and the look-ahead READNEXT at :311 finds an eleventh record, so :313 SETs NEXT-PAGE-YES and WS-MESSAGE is never touched - the message line is 78 spaces. That is the exact complement of case02, where the same look-ahead hit the end of the file. Page size ten is behaviour and not configuration: the eleventh record exists and is deliberately NOT shown (gate G39).",
